  number    = "3-4",
  pages     = "459--483",
  abstract  = "How well can roll calls detect the causal impact of majority
               party agenda setting in Congress? Estimating the counterfactual
               required to assess the effects of majority party agenda setting
               is complicated by time-varying differences in the political
               environment and the fact that measures commonly used to control
