  author    = "Laver, Michael and Benoit, Kenneth and Garry, John",
  journal   = "Am. Polit. Sci. Rev.",
  publisher = "Cambridge University Press",
  volume    =  97,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "311--331",
  abstract  = "We present a new way of extracting policy positions from
               political texts that treats texts not as discourses to be
               understood and interpreted but rather, as data in the form of
               words. We compare this approach to previous methods of text
               analysis and use it to replicate published estimates of the
               policy positions of political parties in Britain and Ireland, on
