  volume    =  99,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "361--371",
  abstract  = "This paper aims at enriching the debate over the measurement of
               majority party influence in contemporary American legislatures.
               Our use of a new analytic technique, a grid-search program for
               characterizing the uncovered set, enables us to begin with a
               better model of legislative proceedings that abandons the simple
