  volume    =  22,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "204--228",
  abstract  = "Why do most African Americans and other racial liberals vote
               Democratic, whereas most racial conservatives—largely whites—vote
               Republican? To what extent is this alignment of race and party
               attributable to the strategic choice of GOP elites to take the
