  number    =  2,
  pages     = "316--323",
  abstract  = "Political symbols such as the Confederate flag and Confederate
               monuments present a certain kind of “stickiness” in meaning,
               interpretation, and ownership. In some instances, a symbol is
               deeply tied to its referent, as is the case for the iconic
               “Hollywood sign” that sits atop the Hollywood Hills in Los
