  journal   = "Publius",
  publisher = "Oxford University Press (OUP)",
  pages     = "jae046",
  abstract  = "Abstract A large-scale study of US local policymaking has long
               been hindered by a lack of centralized data sources. Our own
               project, LocalView, supplements data collection efforts by
               creating the largest existing database of local government
               meeting transcripts, audio, and video yet released. In this
