               on these problems at the scale of statewide precinct graphs for
               more policy informed measures. We develop these improvements
               through the first case study of district plans in Georgia. Our
               analysis projects that any election in Georgia will reliably
               elect 9 Republicans and 5 Democrats under the enacted plan. This
