  volume    =  77,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "653--668",
  abstract  = "Legislative activity—whether votes or communications—is often
               represented in a single partisan or ideological dimension. But as
               lawmakers communicate in various venues (e.g., traditional,
               direct, or social media), the extent to which these estimates are
               interchangeable—reflecting a common underlying dimension—is
