  volume    = "-1",
  number    = "aop",
  pages     = "1--27",
  abstract  = "Like most collective decision-making processes, the formulation,
               adaptation, and implementation of public policies are not immune
               to conflict. Recently, various authors have lamented the lack of
               explicit attention to conflict in the policy process and called
               for more research into how policy conflicts unfold and what
