  volume    =  65,
  number    =  2,
  pages     = "37--57",
  abstract  = "Abstract We know that the Dáil is dominated by the government.
               From 2010 to 2016 there was a clamour for change, which
               ultimately led to significant reforms of the Oireachtas, and
               specifically the Dáil. In this article we show that the basis for
               the weakness of the Dáil was the government’s control of the
