               over the composition of winning coalitions and, consequently, the
               desire for the political ``insurance'' that universalism
               provides.",
  month     =  feb,
  year      =  1981
}

@ARTICLE{Hibbing1982-lo,
  title     = "Voluntary Retirement from the {U}.{S}. House of Representatives:
