  author    = "Hibbing, John R",
  journal   = "American Journal of Political Science",
  publisher = "[Midwest Political Science Association, Wiley]",
  volume    =  26,
  number    =  3,
  pages     =  467,
  abstract  = "[Most observers of Congress know that the number of
               representatives voluntarily retiring from the House increased in
               the 1970s, and there has been much speculation about the causes
               of this increase. For the most part, however, explanations of the
               increase are attempted without a solid understanding of the more
               general motivations for voluntary retirements. In order to
