  volume    =  27,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "33--60",
  abstract  = "Abstract At times, the American political parties are so close in
               terms of policy positions that critics denounce the lack of a
               “dime's worth of difference” between them. At other times, the
               gap between them on a left‐right dimension is huge. How can we
