  volume    =  27,
  number    =  1,
  pages     = "61--85",
  abstract  = "Abstract Four competing explanations have emerged regarding
               restrictive rules in Congress. Informational theory claims that
               rules reduce information costs and facilitate committee
               specialization. The distributional perspective suggests that
