  volume    =  29,
  number    =  3,
  pages     = "407--430",
  abstract  = "Party caucuses are increasingly important to members' allocation
               of time. This article reports findings from new data on the
               minutes, frequency, timing, and attendance of House party caucus
               meetings. I argue that the party caucuses increasingly affect
               political and policy information flows to members. This growing
