               and general importance of perceived food healthiness and
               sustainability. Conversely, adoption is hindered by dietary
               factors and the experiential importance of meat and food
               neophobia.",
  month     =  sep,
  year      =  2020,
  keywords  = "neophobia; structural equation model; willingness to try",
